WEBVTT

00:07:28.611 --> 00:07:30.680
Doo, doo, doo, doo, doo, doo, doo, doo.

00:07:30.714 --> 00:07:32.015
Se parecen.

00:07:32.015 --> 00:07:33.683
(Risas)

00:07:33.717 --> 00:07:37.120
“Oh, I won’t back down.

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:40.957
No, I won’t back down.”

00:07:40.991 --> 00:07:45.795
Versus “Won’t you stay with me

00:07:45.829 --> 00:07:48.598
’cause you’re all I need”.

00:07:48.898 --> 00:07:50.066
Diez notas.

00:07:50.834 --> 00:07:55.338
Doo doo doo doo, doo doo doo doo.

00:07:56.406 --> 00:07:57.574
Versus Katy Perry:

00:07:57.607 --> 00:08:02.245
Doo doo doo doo, doo doo doo, doo.